*require 1.4.22
*begin
*case preserve
*truncate off
*set separator :
*set names ._-
*units default
*calibrate default
*sd default
*flags not duplicate not splay not surface
*infer equates off
*infer plumbs off
*infer exports off
*data normal from to tape compass clino
*declination 0 degrees
1.1 1.0 10.020 270 -45
1.1 1.0 9.980 270 -45
*end
